      "text": "Israel swears by name of the Lord but not in truth or righteousness, 1 Ne. 20:1 (Isa. 48:1). men should partake of goodness of God, lest he swears in wrath they should not enter in, Jacob 1:7. followers of Noah3 have sworn they will return to land of Nephi, Mosiah 19:19. Lamanite king swears oath his people will not destroy Limhi’s people, Mosiah 20:24. Amalickiah swears oath to drink blood of Moroni1, Alma 49:27. secret combination swears not to reveal murderer, Hel. 1:11 (Ether 8:14). Giddianhi swears not to destroy Nephites if they join robbers, 3 Ne. 3:8. swear not at all, 3 Ne. 12:33–37 (Matt. 5:33–37). Nephites swear by heavens they would go to battle against enemies, Morm. 3:10, 14. secret combination sworn by oath of ancients, Ether 9:5.",
